rk3588-board-rock-5b-plus (0.1.6-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Ship a dracut module (50rk3588-mmc) with the same Rockchip MMC modules
    as the initramfs-tools hook, for Ubuntu 25.10+ which defaults to dracut.
  * postinst regenerates the initramfs with dracut when present.

