rk3588-board-rock-5b-plus (0.1.5-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Set U_BOOT_FDT relative to /lib/firmware/<kernel version>/ so each
    kernel boots its own DTB; the old rockchip/... path never resolved.
  * Stop resetting U_BOOT_FDT_OVERLAYS on upgrade, which wiped camera
    overlays enabled with apply-overlays.sh.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

